<title>USA: Saunders Karp says closes SKM Equity Fund II.</title>
<headline>Saunders Karp says closes SKM Equity Fund II.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saunders Karp &amp; Megrue LP, a private New York merchant bank, said it closed a second fund, the SKM Equity Fund II, at $506 million in assets.</p>
<p>The fund invests mostly in private businesses with annual sales of $60 million to $1 billion. One publicly held issue is Dollar Tree Stores Inc, a specialty retail chain.</p>
